        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Beige silk ground with self diaper figure, brocaded with green, blue, yellow, pink and orange-rose silks. Symmetrical pattern showing a formal carnation and rose bouquet on central axis flanked by heavy flowering branches, bearing a variety of flowers and fruit, running vertically. Selvedge on right edge; left turned under. Faded and stained. Creases running down length."@en ;
